<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρᾰκ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστράκινος, λίθος ὀ.</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.146
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				36.139
			</span></i>; also, <i>ostracitis</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρακίας</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				37.177
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρακῖτις, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span></span>, <i>an inferior variety of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδμεία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.151
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>cake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.647f
			</span></i>.</div>
